  "category": "Health & Fitness",
  "core": "Vince of V Shred demonstrates seven biceps exercises: dumbbell hammer curls, seated alternating supinating curls, EZ-bar curls (outer grip for the short head, inner grip for the long head), incline-bench hammer curls (elbow behind the body for the long or outer head), face-down incline hanging curls (elbow in front for the short head), Smith-machine drag curls and dumbbell preacher curls. The constant cues: keep the elbow fixed, don't swing, squeeze at the top and control the negative.",
