    "2. Seated alternating curl: start neutral, then supinate (palm up) past the knee for a stronger peak contraction. Sitting removes knee-bounce momentum. Squeeze at the top and don't swing with your back.",
    "3. EZ-bar curl (easier on the wrists, heavier load), two grips: outer grip (wrists outside the shoulders) targets the short head for thickness; inner grip (wrists inside) targets the outer long head.",
